[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4322.03, "timestamp": "01:12:02", "text": "請不要繼續。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4337.39, "timestamp": "01:12:17", "text": "啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4339.47, "timestamp": "01:12:19", "text": "你找到什麼了嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4341.79, "timestamp": "01:12:21", "text": "數字正在迅速增長。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4342.75, "timestamp": "01:12:22", "text": "它在哪裡？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4345.35, "timestamp": "01:12:25", "text": "那邊，那邊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4348.51, "timestamp": "01:12:28", "text": "在 goingsofar 一方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4349.03, "timestamp": "01:12:29", "text": "驚人的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4351.149, "timestamp": "01:12:31", "text": "哦，那裡好像有東西。是的，有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4356.07, "timestamp": "01:12:36", "text": "這種情況經常發生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4358.83, "timestamp": "01:12:38", "text": "是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4359.229, "timestamp": "01:12:39", "text": "這是什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4362.189, "timestamp": "01:12:42", "text": "另一邊也有類似的東西，所以它們之間肯定存在某種聯繫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4371.95, "timestamp": "01:12:51", "text": "圖片，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4372.669, "timestamp": "01:12:52", "text": "這是什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4374.229, "timestamp": "01:12:54", "text": "哦，這又是一個重要的數字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4376.11, "timestamp": "01:12:56", "text": "我不知道。我失敗了，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4378.31, "timestamp": "01:12:58", "text": "以下"}]